      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ODREM are delighted to present 59 Mask Avenue, Artane, Dublin 5 to the market for sale\r\n\r\nA spacious three-bedroom end terrace family home with two reception rooms, a contemporary kitchen, two bathrooms and a generous rear garden, ideally located in one of Artane's most established residential neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nNo. 59 Mask Avenue presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained family home offering bright, versatile accommodation extending over two floors. Thoughtfully upgraded over the years, the property combines modern conveniences with plenty of potential for future enhancement, making it an ideal choice for growing families and first-time buyers alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a bright front living room featuring a marble fireplace with inset stove. To the rear is a separate family room overlooking the garden, providing additional living space ideal for children's playroom, home office or TV room.\r\n\r\nThe extended galley-style kitchen has been tastefully modernised with sleek high-gloss cabinetry, generous worktop space and ample dining area, with direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite. A contemporary family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys mature front and rear gardens. The rear garden offers excellent privacy together with a substantial garden shed and plenty of space for entertaining, children's play or further landscaping.\r\n\r\nSituated in a highly sought-after location, Mask Avenue is within easy reach of an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, neighbourhood shops, cafés, supermarkets, Artane Castle Shopping Centre, Beaumont Hospital, Dublin City University and numerous sporting and recreational amenities. Excellent transport links, including multiple Dublin Bus routes and easy access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport, ensure convenient travel to the city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nThis is a wonderful opportunity to purchase a spacious family home in an established neighbourhood with excellent amenities on its doorstep."
